        "nobel_worthiness": "Opening a new observational window on the high-energy universe through the detection of astrophysical neutrinos is a major advance in both astronomy and particle astrophysics.",
        "attribution": "The observatory required sustained work on detector design, deployment and analysis. These three are plausible choices for leadership and foundational contributions, though credit across a large collaboration needs careful review.",
