      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The experimental discovery of the Higgs boson completed a central prediction of the Standard Model and required extraordinary detectors and international coordination.",
        "attribution": "These names represent leadership in the two experiments that made the discovery. Recognition would need to make clear that the achievement depended on thousands of contributors and complementary teams.",
        "maturity": "The particle's properties have since been studied extensively and remain consistent with the Higgs boson expected by the Standard Model.",
